@@ -341,3 +341,4 @@ Reserved:
   0195 adds Sable presets for Tubi (`com.tubitv`), Google TV (`com.google.android.videos`) and YouTube Music (`com.google.android.apps.youtube.music`): Tall phone with landscape video Fit, like YouTube and Instagram (owner's videos, 2026-11-12). The shipped-presets test now also checks Fit.
   0196 drops the home's Permissions page as well (owner, 2026-11-12): SableHomeAccess already grants them, so Launcher settings and first-run setup open on Appearance & Home, the steps renumber 1-5, the Review page loses its Permissions card, and the Next/Back footer (`Settings2Flow`) no longer walks into the removed Permissions or Active Frames pages. The Weather hint points to Android Settings > Apps for location; `home_access` checks it.
   0197 fixes Active Frames' empty pictures on Android 17 (owner log 2026-11-12: "snapshot of task 85 has no hardware buffer"): `SableTaskSnapshots` no longer closes the snapshot's HardwareBuffer itself, which emptied the snapshot TaskSnapshotManager keeps in its cache; it copies the picture through `TaskSnapshot.wrapToBitmap` and releases it with `closeBuffer()`, asks for RESOLUTION_ANY when the wanted resolution has none, and logs what an empty snapshot holds.
+  0198 fixes the Privacy Screen dimming nothing in Chrome (owner, 2026-11-12): a focused item that fills the screen, such as a web page, made the clear band the whole screen. `PrivacyBand` now centres the band on the visible part of the focused item and keeps it to a third of the screen (or the minimum band, if more); `SablePrivacy` logs each switch and a shade that fails to show.
